{"id": "61347", "title": "无言呀", "author": "嗜睡小师妹", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 18, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/61/61347.htm", "intro": "属性分类：古代／异国背景／未定／未定\r\n\r\n关键字：主角 　配角 　其他\r\n\r\n文案：\r\n\r\n 她生于动荡末年，先皇平定内乱，开启新皇朝的那一夜。视为吉祥。\r\n她三岁随父母入宫觐见，破了先皇的难题，得圣恩欢喜，赐如意。\r\n六岁入宫，误食了太子的毒羹，替太子挡下一劫。\r\n先皇说这丫头命里带旺，赐封太子妃。\r\n养病三年，年方九岁，随长宫女入宫。\r\n太子15岁承帝位，下令皇宫内修建水上行宫，赐太子妃，以慰当日舍身之恩，传为佳话。\r\n且说太子妃当日大难不死，却从此失去声音。\r\n无巧不成书，\r\n此女名唤无言。", "base": "files/article/html/61/61347", "chapters": [{"title": "1-4", "file": "9037161.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5-8", "file": "9037164.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9-12", "file": "9037167.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13-15", "file": "9037169.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-18", "file": "9037171.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19-21", "file": "9037172.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22-24", "file": "9037174.html", "available": false}, {"title": "25-27", "file": "9037176.html", "available": false}, {"title": "28-30", "file": "9037178.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-33", "file": "9037180.html", "available": false}, {"title": "34-36", "file": "9037181.html", "available": false}, {"title": "37-38", "file": "9037184.html", "available": false}, {"title": "39-43", "file": "9037187.html", "available": false}, {"title": "44-49", "file": "9037189.html", "available": false}, {"title": "50-54", "file": "9037191.html", "available": false}, {"title": "55-57", "file": "9037193.html", "available": false}, {"title": "58-59", "file": "9037195.html", "available": false}, {"title": "60-61完结", "file": "9037198.html", "available": false}]}